instagram.body:
AI is moving fast and I’d rather learn from real people than algorithm rabbit holes.

These are the five creators I’m currently paying attention to:

@cahdoria for the ethics lens
@askcatgpt because she makes it human, not hype
@harpercarrollai for the actual technical stuff, explained clearly
@alliekmiller for the business angle
@taylaburrell for systems and how to actually use it day to day

Follow for more
